[Options]

[A.]
<h2>Kidnapped</h2>
<i>Your friend will soon die.  As so will you.<br>
--Anonymous</i>  
<p>The Bounties fled to a magical place where your knowledge disappeared and the Furies can't interfere.  The Furies used all of their power to muster up some simple knowledge for you.  So, since they can't give you knowledge yet, they send you some help.  A spirit form of themselves.<br>
You must save the Lost Priest of Nimbus who was kidnapped.

$Button=Review Knowledge,ShowTechnology,55
$Button=Play Mission,DoNothing,0

