[Succeeded][BadTeamDead]
<h2>You've rescued him!</h2>
<p>The Nimbian King gives you his daughter's hand in marriage.  It would be rude to turn him down, even if she is the ugliest woman on Nimbus.<br>
Will you accept or face certain prosecution?  Continued............

